    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-58090",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-26T04:35:10.739Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-26T04:35:10.739Z",
      "description": "The SOCK_STREAM receive path in the unix socket implementation failed to fully detach control messages from the socket buffer before processing them.  Some error paths would free those messages, leaving freed data mbufs in the receive socket buffer.\n\nAn unprivileged local user can exploit this use-after-free to escalate privileges.",
      "severity": "5.5",
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：FreeBSD FreeBSD\n🔓 漏洞类型：Use After Free (CWE-416)\n📊 官方评级：MEDIUM (CVSS 5.5)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://security.freebsd.org/advisories/FreeBSD-SA-26:57.unix.asc",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
      "affected": [
